===
g upper partials.'—(MS. communications.) Mr. Blaikley kindly sounded for me the same instrument with different mouthpieces or cups, to show the great difference of quality they produce. In the great bass bombardon on which he produced a tone of 40 vib., the tone was, even at that depth, remarkably rich and fine, owing to the large and deep cup extinguishing the beating upper partials.
